WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.865 --> 00:00:06.135
Well, so much for taking a few 
days off, huh partner?

00:00:08.738 --> 00:00:09.639
The next chapter begins.

00:00:09.739 --> 00:00:11.407
Beauregard Brady Westin,

00:00:11.407 --> 00:00:14.544
this is Hope Alice Williams Brady.

00:00:14.777 --> 00:00:16.145
With old favorites.

00:00:16.145 --> 00:00:17.780
Say, "Johnsons!"

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:19.649
Johnsons!

00:00:20.183 --> 00:00:21.317
New faces.

00:00:21.317 --> 00:00:22.986
Mom, who is it?

00:00:23.653 --> 00:00:25.455
And globetrotting adventures.

00:00:25.955 --> 00:00:27.490
How are you in frequent flyer miles?

00:00:33.262 --> 00:00:35.131
Push further beyond Salem.

00:00:35.131 --> 00:00:36.633
Dammit, Mom, where have you been?

00:00:37.634 --> 00:00:39.702
What the hell have you been doing
for the past two years?

00:00:39.702 --> 00:00:40.837
Where past...

00:00:40.837 --> 00:00:42.538
No! No, no, no.

00:00:42.538 --> 00:00:44.340
and present collide.

00:00:44.707 --> 00:00:47.110
In the ultimate &lt;i&gt;Days of our Lives &lt;/i&gt;event.

00:00:48.711 --> 00:00:50.279
What are you up to, Fancy Face?

00:00:54.484 --> 00:00:55.885
Well, let's get to work.

